      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosedale%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When Parke County formed in 1821, Rosedale became its first village and county seat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosedale%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened in Rosedale in 1861 and continues to serve residents today.",
