        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosedale%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rosedale serves as the gateway to Parke County and the annual Covered Bridge Festival.",
